      "content": "it’s not just a scar though. it’s like the foundation is gone. i used to have a purpose, i had a place in the world. now i walk into a room and i can feel everyone judging me, even people who don't know me. the shame is just... it's constant. it’s exhausting to keep pretending that there’s something left to save.",
