    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what's the point of finding one brick? the whole world sees the ruins. there's no going back to who i was. i look at my life and i just see a massive, irreversible mistake. it feels like the universe is telling me that this is where my story ends, and honestly, it feels more honest than trying to find some 'grit' to keep going. it just feels like it would be so much quieter if i just stopped fighting it.",
